            <ArticleTitle>The pharmacist's role in self-care.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>S40-1</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Self-care involves a variety of actions that patients take to manage their health. Pharmacists play an important role in guiding patient's self-care behaviors. Thorough assessment and effective communication are crucial to meaningful self-care counseling. Pharmacists can act as advocates who empower patients and help them make sound decisions about self-care.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
